OL,3,GNEWSAWildlife catapult attacks go on
OL,4,Adespite crackdown
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn animal welfare group has warned that
OL,7,Fcatapult attacks on wildlife are
OL,8,Fincreasing despite a national
OL,9,Fcrackdown.
OL,11,FCheshunt Animal Rescue, in
OL,12,FHertfordshire, said ducks and swans
OL,13,Fwere being killed or suffering serious
OL,14,Finjuries after being hit.
OL,16,FHertfordshire Police joined a national
OL,17,Finitiative, Operation Lakeshot, in May
OL,18,Fafter reporting "an increase in reports
OL,19,Fof youths intentionally targeting
OL,20,Fwildlife".
